Z||000003||maryjane||12-02-2001||04:15 PM||||Click on Ogre's Cave at the top of the page.<BR>A screen will come up as an indroduction that gives you options to go fwd or leave. It probably will fwd you to the main page. If not, click on the link that says something like " click here to take you there now".<BR>When the new screen opens up, read it. On the left side are several option boxes. Click on the "Engine" section. A drop down menu will appear. Click on "coolant fill". You may or may not have to click "go". New screen opens. Read it ALL! when you're thru in that area, go back and clcik on the thermostat section. Read it & write down the part#s concerning thermostats. I think this is correct.||||reg||1
